# state_normalization.py AI Check

- [ ] Normalizer maps raw axis-value aliases to explicit canonical axis values without model calls.
- [ ] Normalizer treats problem, strategy, representation, knowledge, lifecycle and legacy axes independently.
- [ ] Evaluator enforces full occurrence × required-axis coverage.
- [ ] Evaluator enforces MUST_LINK, CANNOT_LINK and EXACT_VALUE constraints without collapsing axes.
- [ ] Invalid aliases, duplicates, schema drift and nonfinite JSON fail closed.
